#: cuda.tile._stub.arange:1 of
msgid ""
"Creates a 1-D tile of length ``size`` with values ``start, start + step, "
"..., start + (size - 1) * step``."
msgstr ""
"创建长度为 ``size`` 的一维 Tile，其元素值为 ``start, start + step, ..., start + (size -"
" 1) * step`` 。"

